      "text": "```\nRESPIRATORY SYSTEM: Two Jobs\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  1. GAS EXCHANGE: O₂ in / CO₂ out                        │\n│  2. pH REGULATION: blow off CO₂ → raise pH               │\n│     (fastest pH regulator — renal is slower but more     │\n│     precise; respiratory: seconds-minutes)               │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
